00:01:08.277 --> 00:01:11.822
Karena kami keluargamu, Nak.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:14.199
Hei, Sayang.

00:01:14.283 --> 00:01:16.451
Tadi pagi aku didatangi Cole.

00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:19.162
Apa pun yang kalian cari, hentikan.

00:01:19.246 --> 00:01:21.498
