00:04:31.188 --> 00:04:32.439
Tak ada.

00:04:34.191 --> 00:04:35.275
Kita harus bergegas.

00:04:35.859 --> 00:04:37.694
Satu menit. Satu menit lagi.

00:04:39.696 --> 00:04:41.907
