00:05:58.070 --> 00:05:59.404
Ya. Kubilang hampir selesai.

00:05:59.488 --> 00:06:01.031
Fokus membantu kami saja.

00:06:01.114 --> 00:06:03.909
Aku ambil bahan salad,
kau ambil granula favoritnya.

00:06:03.992 --> 00:06:06.745
