Buatkan racikan...

00:09:44.296 --> 00:09:46.465
Lalu pulanglah ke keluargamu.

00:10:02.898 --> 00:10:03.899
Bottles.

00:10:07.402 --> 00:10:10.280
Jika disuruh ambilkan, lakukan.
Jika disuruh aduk, lakukan.

00:10:10.989 --> 00:10:12.532
Apa pun pintanya, lakukan.

00:10:17.412 --> 00:10:19.039
Jangan lancang seperti tadi lagi.

00:10:19.581 --> 00:10:21.958
