00:12:20.957 --> 00:12:23.668
Ada. Di perusahaan keripik
atau semacamnya.

00:12:23.751 --> 00:12:25.169
Pekerjaannya mencicipi rasa.

00:12:25.753 --> 00:12:26.838
Pencicip makanan.

00:12:27.338 --> 00:12:28.339
Itu impianku.

00:12:28.423 --> 00:12:29.799
Baiklah.

00:12:31.384 --> 00:12:33.678
Badut rodeo.

00:12:33.761 --> 00:12:36.097
Ih, Letty. Jangan.

00:12:36.598 --> 00:12:37.974
Mereka jahat pada hewan.

00:12:41.102 --> 00:12:42.437
Aku tahu.

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:43.771
Penguji kasur.

00:12:44.355 --> 00:12:47.734
