Nah, kencangkan.

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:09.083
- Kanan kendur.
- Bagus. Bagus sekali.

00:15:09.167 --> 00:15:10.585
Di sini, lebih kencang lagi.

00:15:11.085 --> 00:15:12.462
Di sini.

00:15:20.928 --> 00:15:22.180
Kemarilah.

00:15:25.516 --> 00:15:27.018
Masuklah, Nak.

00:15:27.101 --> 00:15:28.102
Mainlah dengan Maria.

