00:20:46.257 --> 00:20:47.842
Namaku Patricia Devlin.

00:20:47.925 --> 00:20:51.387
Asisten Deputi Inspektur Jenderal
Divisi Penyidikan,

00:20:51.471 --> 00:20:53.765
