- Aku benar.

00:24:59.302 --> 00:25:01.012
Kau sudah menginjak-injakku!

00:25:01.596 --> 00:25:02.888
Pikirmu, "Bagus.

00:25:02.972 --> 00:25:07.143
Sementara bosku jungkir balik
